{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blind Box</strong> is a simple game where you collect blind boxes, unbox them to collect cute figurines and put them on display!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lounge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your blind boxes and grow your figurine collection! Complete full sets and show them off to your friends. It\u2019s not just figurines\u2014discover boxes for furniture, pets, and other unique items too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836710/extras/d6f83bef796a6dc65096d93c084dfb76.poster.avif?t=1757309869\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836710/extras/d6f83bef796a6dc65096d93c084dfb76.webm?t=1757309869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Home</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each figurine in your home, passively earn fame and reach milestones to unlock furniture's, pets, and other cool rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836710/extras/a3839852083d421c4c8422eafb5bad7a.poster.avif?t=1757309869\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836710/extras/a3839852083d421c4c8422eafb5bad7a.webm?t=1757309869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passively earn flyers and redeem them for blind boxes at the Blind Box Shop! Shops restock every <strong>00:00 UTC</strong> and <strong>12:00 UTC</strong>! (Some shops are always in st